Replace busy-wait loops with sleeping waits

The interface code paces itself with `while (elapsed_time(t) < n) {}` loops and
the movie player spins on the clock between frames. A browser tab runs the
engine on the same thread as rendering, input and audio, so a spinning loop
freezes all three. Every such loop now sleeps (SDL_Delay) until its deadline.
Timing is unchanged; CPU use while waiting drops to zero on every platform.
Fallout 2 CE made the same change in 2023.
